hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1451","Abdullah bin Saeed Al-Ashjaj told us, Ibn Idris told us, on the authority of Husayn, on the authority of Amara bin Ruwaybah, that Bishr bin Marwan saw He ascended the pulpit, raising his hands, and said: “May God bless these hands. I saw the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, doing nothing more than pointing with his finger.”"
